==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sъsora}}; compare {{cog|cu|сваръ|t=quarrel}}. Ultimately derived from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*swer-}}; further related to {{cog|en|swear}} via {{cog|gem-pro|*swarō}}.

{{etystub|ru}}

